.TH SIEVE 1.SH NAMEsieve \- the sieve of Eratosthenes as a benchmark.SH SYNOPSIS\fBsieve\fR.SH DESCRIPTION\fBsieve\fRruns the classic prime-number sieve a hundred times over, printing\fBstart\fRfirst and\fB 100 sieves done\fRat the end.  What it measures is the time between those two lines, sorun it under your own OS-9's\fBtime\fRto get a figure to compare..SH NOTESNeeds Microware's\fBcio\fR.\fR.SH SEE ALSOsavage, dhrystone